---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
description: Tabeebna is a Bahrain-based student-run nonprofit helping high school students explore career paths through internships, events, and workshops.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Student-run · Manama, Bahrain</p>
    <h1>Helping Bahrain's students discover the career path that fits them.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Tabeebna connects high schoolers with internships, career-exposure events, and workshops led by students who've walked the same path — giving them a clearer, more confident view of what their future career could look like.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/programs/' | url }}">See open opportunities</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/apply/' | url }}">Apply now</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% include "skyline.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% include "steth-divider.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Right now</p>
      <h2>Applications are open</h2>
      <p class="lede">Check the Programs page for current deadlines — new internships and workshops are added throughout the year.</p>
    </div>

    {% if opportunities.length > 0 %}
      <div class="opportunities-list">
        {% for item in opportunities | limit(3) %}
          <article class="opportunity-card">
            <div class="opportunity-card__top">
              <span class="opportunity-card__category">{{ item.category }}</span>
              <span class="opportunity-card__deadline">Due {{ item.deadline | niceDate }}</span>
            </div>
            <h3>{{ item.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ item.description }}</p>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="{{ item.applyLink }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apply</a>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:24px"><a href="{{ '/programs/' | url }}">See all opportunities →</a></p>
    {% else %}
      <div class="empty-state">
        <p>Nothing posted yet — check back soon, or see <a href="{{ '/programs/' | url }}">the Programs page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--mist">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--3">
    <div class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 — Explore</p>
      <h3>Shadow real professionals</h3>
      <p>Spend time inside real workplaces across Bahrain — from hospitals to studios to startups — guided by students who've already been there.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">02 — Learn</p>
      <h3>Hands-on workshops</h3>
      <p>Practical skill sessions and honest talks about what different careers actually look like day to day.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 — Connect</p>
      <h3>A community, not just a program</h3>
      <p>Meet other students figuring out the same path, and mentors who remember being exactly where you are.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
